WEBVTT

00:03:57.597 --> 00:04:00.030
Opraviti moram veliko stvari,
narediti vtis na ljudi

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.530
in obiskati številne kraje."

00:04:01.563 --> 00:04:02.797
In rekli so: "To!"

00:04:02.797 --> 00:04:04.430
(Smeh)

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:07.563
Ko dovolj dolgo to ponavljaš,
postane del tebe.

00:04:09.197 --> 00:04:15.997
(Aplavz)

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.563
Dala sem jim test z 20 vprašanji.

00:04:19.797 --> 00:04:21.997
Učenec je napačno odgovoril
na 18 vprašanj.

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:25.930
Na test sem mu napisala +2
in narisala velikega smeška.

00:04:25.963 --> 00:04:27.630
(Smeh)

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:30.630
Vprašal me je: "Ga. Pierson, je to cvek?"